Release 0.13.0.

Changelog: 26-10-2026 01:58:47

Added. Connect is a pill in the window's header, beside the three states and as wide as they are (owner,
26-10-2026): a click connects the SFTP Client with the fields in its tab, it reads Connecting… while it connects
and Disconnect once connected, and the tab's own Connect button is gone. In that tab the password rules always
show, on two lines in the column at the right of the connection form where Connect was, in muted text until a
password is typed and then in red with what is missing or in green with a check; the form itself, and the Server
Manager, are as they were.

Changelog: 26-10-2026 01:04:02

Fixed. The errors button is the suite's red #c62828, and the password warning, requirements met and not met use
the suite's text tints #ffb74d, #81c784 and #e57373 (DESIGN.md's color families, owner, 26-10-2026), not colors of
their own.

