Changelog: 23-10-2026 20:12:54

Release 0.9.0.

Changelog: 23-10-2026 19:35:48

Added. The SFTP Client selects more than one file or folder (Ctrl-click, Shift-click): Upload, Download
and Delete act on all of them, with one question for a delete. Files and folders dragged onto the remote
list, from the local list or a file manager, upload to the open remote folder; a drop is always a copy. With
more than one transfer, the question about an existing target offers to do the same for the others.

Fixed. Upload with the parent folder row (..) selected no longer queues the whole parent folder.

